abstract: >-
  Command reference and analysis scripts accompanying the study of evolutionary
  patterns and repeated adaptive strategies in deep-sea anemones. The repository
  documents genome and transcriptome processing and the identification of
  deep-sea-specific amino acid variants and genes.
keywords:
  - deep-sea anemones
  - Actiniaria
  - comparative genomics
